{"Title":"An Act relative to commercial driver's licenses","BillNumber":"H5109","DocketNumber":"HD5497","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-11-15T10:50:19.43"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5109/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSection 9 of chapter 90F of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-  \r\n\t(I) A person shall not be disqualified from operating a commercial vehicle under paragraphs (A) or (B) based upon convictions occurring on or before September 30, 2005, unless: (i) the person has 3 or more convictions for operating under the influence under section 24 of chapter 90 or (ii) disqualification is required under 49 C.F.R. 383.51 or any other federal statute or regulation.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to amend the lookback period for certain disqualifying offenses for commercial driver’s licenses, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H5139","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5139/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H5109","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5109/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}